{"t":"CIFR","made":"2026-11-24 14:32","name":"Cipher Digital Inc.","ko":"사이퍼마이닝","sector":"Technology","industry":"Information Technology Services","employees":66,"hq":"New York, NY, United States","website":"https://www.cipherdigital.com","summary_en":"Cipher Digital Inc., together with its subsidiaries, develops and operates industrial-scale data centers for bitcoin mining and high-performance compute (HPC) hosting in the United States. It develops HPC data center facilities across various sites for hyperscaler tenants; operates power at one bitcoin mining data center; and maintains a pipeline across various sites. The company was formerly known as Cipher Mining Inc. and change its name to Cipher Digital Inc. in February 2026. The company was founded in 2021 and is headquartered in New York, New York.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"Cipher Digital Inc.는 자회사와 함께 미국에서 비트코인 ​​채굴 및 고성능 컴퓨팅(HPC) 호스팅을 위한 산업 규모의 데이터 센터를 개발하고 운영합니다. 하이퍼스케일러 테넌트를 위해 다양한 사이트에 걸쳐 HPC 데이터 센터 시설을 개발합니다. 하나의 비트코인 ​​채굴 데이터 센터에서 전력을 운영합니다. 다양한 사이트에 걸쳐 파이프라인을 유지 관리합니다. 이 회사는 이전에 Cipher Mining Inc.로 알려졌으며 2026년 2월에 Cipher Digital Inc.로 이름을 변경했습니다. 이 회사는 2021년에 설립되었으며 뉴욕주 뉴욕에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":6.2,"mcap":2829463552.0,"pe":null,"fpe":75.60975,"peg":null,"ps":19.368345,"pb":4.28769,"ev_ebitda":346.819,"div":0.0,"beta":3.541,"hi52":30.14,"lo52":5.071},"fin":{"rev":146087008.0,"rev_g":-0.628,"eps_g":null,"gross":-0.52658004,"op":-0.59641,"net":0.0,"roe":-1.53919,"fcf":-3427504384.0,"cash":656009024.0,"debt":5619225088.0,"de":897.747,"eps":-3.15,"feps":0.082},"own":{"short":0.22049999,"inst":0.94852996,"insider":0.03226},"analyst":{"n":22,"mean":22.86364,"median":19.5,"high":59.0,"low":9.5,"rec":"strong_buy","recMean":1.45455,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":4,"buy":15,"hold":3,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":5,"buy":15,"hold":2,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":5,"buy":15,"hold":2,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":3